# Data Validation Standards

## Input Validation

- Validate all user inputs on both client and server
- Use Zod schema validation (`lib/validations/`)
- Sanitize inputs to prevent XSS

## Tenant Schemas

Use schemas from [`lib/validations/tenant.ts`](lib/validations/tenant.ts):

- `onboardingSchema` — registro de barbería (`/api/onboarding`)
- `tenantSettingsSchema` — config tenant (`/api/admin/settings`)
- `slugSchema` — subdominio: `^[a-z0-9-]{3,30}$`, reservados: app, www, api, admin, platform, registro
- `customDomainSchema` — dominio Pro

## Booking Validation

- Server: [`app/api/bookings/route.ts`](app/api/bookings/route.ts) — `bookingSchema`
- Client: [`components/BookingFormNew.tsx`](components/BookingFormNew.tsx)
- Phone Colombia: 10 dígitos client-side, `+57` prefix server-side
- Dates: `isValidBookingDateTime()` with tenant `scheduleJson`

## Date/Time Validation

- Always validate dates are in the future (min 1h advance)
- Check against tenant operating hours (`TenantSettings.scheduleJson`)
- Max advance: `maxAdvanceDays` from tenant settings (default 30)

## Multitenant Validation

- Resolve tenant before validating tenant-scoped data
- Verify FK ownership: `barberId` must belong to resolved `tenantId`
- Never accept `tenantId` from client body — use middleware header
